{"created": "2026-04-27T15:16:01.195176+00:00", "modified": "2026-04-27T15:16:01.944846+00:00", "id": 19421439, "conceptrecid": "19421438", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.19421439", "conceptdoi": "10.5281/zenodo.19421438", "doi_url": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.19421439", "metadata": {"title": "Metadata for TDCOSMO XXVI: Uniform Lens Modeling of Eight Doubly Imaged Quasars", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.19421439", "publication_date": "2026-04-27", "description": "<div>\n<div>Modeling notebooks for TDCOSMO: Uniform Lens Modeling of Eight Doubly Imaged Quasars. The data products include:</div>\n<div>1) joint_modeling: Stores the outputs for the FULL IMAGE JOINT MODELING, including the fitting notebook, photometry notebook, and cosmology notebook.</div>\n<div>2) conjugate_point: This directory stores the outputs for the CONJUGATE POINT MODELING.</div>\n<div>3) no_source: Stores the model results for full image modeling without the inclusion of a source profile.</div>\n<div>4) cutout_data: PSF outputs for all systems in the sample, alongside old image cutouts and old files that modeled the systems via single band fits.</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>Follow the instructions at <a href=\"https://github.com/brady-ryan/doubles_modeling/tree/main\">brady-ryan/doubles_modeling</a> to reperform the analyses described in the paper.</div>\n</div>", "access_right": "open", "creators": [{"name": "Brady, Ryan", "affiliation": "Stony Brook University", "orcid": "0009-0003-1338-6336"}], "custom": {"code:codeRepository": "https://github.com/brady-ryan/doubles_modeling/tree/main"}, "resource_type": {"title": "Dataset", "type": "dataset"}, "license": {"id": "cc-by-4.0"}, "relations": {"version": [{"index": 0, "is_last": true, "parent": {"pid_type": "recid", "pid_value": "19421438"}}]}}, "title": "Metadata for TDCOSMO XXVI: Uniform Lens Modeling of Eight Doubly Imaged Quasars", "links": {"self": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/19421439", "self_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/19421439", "preview